    "pi_founders_about": {
      "type": "pi-founders",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1171275733.png",
        "subheading": "Behind Puerto Ink",
        "text_1": "<p>Puerto Ink was founded in <strong>2016</strong> by two brothers, <strong>Vangelis and Michalis</strong>, from <strong>Heraklion, Crete</strong>. With a deep passion for art and craftsmanship, they started their journey with a vision to create a tattoo and piercing studio that blended creativity, precision, and professionalism.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p>What began as a small local studio quickly gained recognition for its high-quality artistry and customer experience. Driven by innovation and dedication, they opened their <strong>first studio in Heraklion</strong>, setting the foundation for what would become a renowned name in the industry.</p>",
        "text_3": "<p>In six years, they expanded internationally, opening a studio in <strong>Antwerp, Belgium</strong>, followed by <strong>Amsterdam and Athens</strong>, establishing Puerto Ink as a global brand.</p>",
        "text_4": "<p>Today, with a team of <strong>35+ skilled professionals</strong>, Puerto Ink continues to grow, offering world-class tattoos, piercings, and premium jewelry while staying true to its artistic roots.</p>",
        "text": "Puerto Ink was founded in 2016 by two brothers, Vangelis and Michalis, from Heraklion, Crete. With a deep passion for art and craftsmanship, they started their journey with a vision to create a tattoo and piercing studio that blended creativity, precision, and professionalism.\n\nWhat began as a small local studio quickly gained recognition for its high-quality artistry and customer experience. Driven by innovation and dedication, they opened their first studio in Heraklion, setting the foundation for what would become a renowned name in the industry.\n\nIn six years, they expanded internationally, opening a studio in Antwerp, Belgium, followed by Amsterdam and Athens, establishing Puerto Ink as a global brand.\n\nToday, with a team of 35+ skilled professionals, Puerto Ink continues to grow, offering world-class tattoos, piercings, and premium jewelry while staying true to its artistic roots."
      }
